{'symbol': 'LUV', 'date': '2023-05-03 14:00:00', 'title': 'SOUTHWEST AIRLINES SHOWCASES ITS HEART FOR CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP WITH RELEASE OF ANNUAL REPORTS', 'text': 'THE ONE REPORT AND DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION REPORT FEATURE KEY PEOPLE, PERFORMANCE, AND PLANET INITIATIVES DALLAS , MAY 3, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SOUTHWEST AIRLINES CO. \xa0(NYSE: LUV) TODAY ANNOUNCES THE LAUNCH OF ITS ANNUAL CORPORATE SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY REPORTS, WITH THE RELEASE OF THE SOUTHWEST AIRLINES® ONE REPORT AND THE DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION (DEI) REPORT. SOUTHWEST AIRLINES ONE REPORT SOUTHWEST AIRLINES DIVERSITY, EQUITY, AND INCLUSION REPORT SOUTHWEST® PRIDES ITSELF ON APPROACHING ITS CORPORATE CITIZENSHIP INITIATIVES HOLISTICALLY.'}